msgid "Code"
msgstr "编码"

#. module: sn_wsd_partner
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sn_wsd_partner.field_sn_wsd_supplier_group__code
msgid ""
"Number of the group as the account shows it: two digits for a top-level "
"group (01, 99) and the parent number plus a serial for a sub-group "
"(10.001). It is also the prefix of the supplier code, and each group counts "
"its own serial on top of it."
msgstr "分组的编号，与账套一致：顶层分组为两位（01、99），子分组为父编号加流水（10.001）。它同时是供应商编码的前置部分，每个分组各自在此之上计数。"

